<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 980 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">ATL Manager access and isolation diagram</title><desc id="desc">Three trust zones. Sources are read-only and feed intake. The single state file is the brain, and the runner is its only writer, validating actor and transition each time. Task work happens in isolated worktrees, clones, or scratch dirs. Active checkouts are never touched. A strip lists which role may write which state fields.</desc><defs><style>text{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;fill:#1a1826}.t{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}.l{font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.s{font-size:11px;fill:#5d5b72}.z{fill:#ffffff;stroke:#dedde6;stroke-dasharray:6 5}.n{stroke-width:1}.p{fill:#ffffff;stroke:#3565d6}.r{fill:#d9f2ea;stroke:#0a7d66}.v{fill:#e8e2fb;stroke:#bb4534}.x{fill:#f8eed7;stroke:#9a6709}.e{stroke:#c3b9f2;stroke-width:2;fill:none}.f{stroke:#bb4534;stroke-width:2;fill:none;stroke-dasharray:6 4}</style><marker id="a" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8z" fill="#c3b9f2"/></marker><marker id="c" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8z" fill="#bb4534"/></marker></defs><text x="24" y="36" class="t">ATL Manager · how the team accesses work</text><text x="24" y="58" class="s">One state brain, isolated workspaces, read-only sources. The runner is the only writer, and it checks the actor every time.</text><rect x="20" y="90" width="260" height="240" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="36" y="112" class="l">SOURCES — read only</text><g transform="translate(36 126)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Inbox markdown</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">.trust/manager/inbox/*.md</text></g><g transform="translate(36 190)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">GitHub issues</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">unauth · GITHUB_TOKEN · gh</text></g><g transform="translate(36 254)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Azure Boards</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">WIQL · sprint iteration · PAT</text></g><rect x="350" y="90" width="280" height="240" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="366" y="112" class="l">STATE — the single brain</text><g transform="translate(366 126)"><rect width="248" height="86" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="25" class="l">state.json</text><text x="13" y="46" class="s">tasks · evidence · blockers</text><text x="13" y="63" class="s">timers · decisions · budgets</text></g><g transform="translate(366 228)"><rect width="248" height="54" rx="10" class="n x"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">The runner validates</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">actor + transition + evidence</text></g><rect x="700" y="90" width="260" height="240" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="716" y="112" class="l">WORKSPACES — isolated</text><g transform="translate(716 126)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n r"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">git worktree</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">branch atl/&lt;task-id&gt;</text></g><g transform="translate(716 190)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n r"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">shallow clone</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">per task · disposable</text></g><g transform="translate(716 254)"><rect width="228" height="54" rx="10" class="n r"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">scratch dir</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">doc and planning tasks</text></g><path d="M280 170h70" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="292" y="162" class="s">intake</text><path d="M630 160h70" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="638" y="152" class="s">workspace</text><path d="M700 206h-70" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="640" y="224" class="s">evidence</text><g transform="translate(700 360)"><rect width="260" height="54" rx="10" class="n v"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Active checkouts</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">never touched by workers</text></g><path d="M830 330v30" class="f" marker-end="url(#c)"/><text x="842" y="350" class="s">no direct writes</text><g transform="translate(20 360)"><rect width="640" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="16" y="23" class="l">Who may write what</text><text x="16" y="42" class="s">Mira: assignment · Pip: objective + checks · Rowan: checkpoint + evidence · Sage: review verdict · Beacon: finish verdict</text></g><text x="24" y="448" class="s">Rule: no agent edits state or repos directly — every change is a runner command with an actor.</text></svg>
